### ====================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ====================================================================

# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION — REGISTER
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Register User Baru (Sukses)
### Response akan mengembalikan api_token dan data user
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 2.2 Register — Validasi Error (Password kurang dari 6 karakter) [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Bu",
  "username": "b",
  "password": "123"
}

### 2.3 Register — Conflict Error (Username sudah terdaftar) [Expect: 409 Conflict]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}


### ====================================================================
### 3. AUTHENTICATION — LOGIN
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 Login (Sukses)
### Response akan mengembalikan jwt_token & api_token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 3.2 Login — Kredensial Salah [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "password_salah"
}


### ====================================================================
### 4. USER PROFILE (PROTECTED BY JWT)
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Get Profile — Mengambil token otomatis dari response login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Get Profile — Menggunakan variable manual @authToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 Get Profile — Tanpa Token / Token Kosong [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 5. OPENAI-COMPATIBLE MODELS (UNTUK 9ROUTER / ONE-API / NEXTCHAT)
### ====================================================================

### 5.1 Get Models List — GET /v1/models (Dibutuhkan saat 9router klik "Fetch Models")
# @name getModelsV1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 Get Models List — GET /models (Untuk router yang baseURL-nya tanpa /v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/models
Accept: application/json

### 5.3 Get Model Detail — GET /v1/models/zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 6. OPENAI-COMPATIBLE CHAT COMPLETIONS (UNTUK 9ROUTER / OPENAI SDK)
### ====================================================================

### 6.1 Chat Completions — POST /v1/chat/completions (Standar 9router)
# @name chatCompletions
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "Kamu adalah asisten pintar."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Halo! Siapa kamu dan apa kemampuanmu?"
    }
  ]
}

### 6.3 Chat Completions — POST /v1/chat/completions dengan STREAMING (stream: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hitung 1 sampai 5."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

### 6.4 Anthropic Messages — POST /v1/messages dengan STREAMING (stream: true) [Format Trae / 9router]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Halo, tes streaming dari 9router."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}



### ====================================================================
### 7. AI GENERATE (CUSTOM SINGLE PROMPT /v1/messages)
### ====================================================================

### 7.1 AI Generate — Menggunakan model default dari .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Jelaskan keunggulan bahasa Go (Golang) dalam 2 kalimat singkat."
}

### 7.2 AI Generate — Custom Model & Prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "prompt": "Halo, Apa itu AI?"
}

### 7.3 AI Generate — Menggunakan Header Authorization: Bearer <api_token>
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Sebutkan 3 tips produktivitas programming."
}


### ====================================================================
### 8. NEGATIVE TESTING / ERROR CASES UNTUK AI ENDPOINT
### ====================================================================

### 8.1 AI Generate — Tanpa API Key [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Tes tanpa API key"
}

### 8.2 AI Generate — API Key Salah / Palsu [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hf_invalid_token_1234567890

{
  "prompt": "Tes dengan token palsu"
}

### 8.3 AI Generate — Prompt Kosong / Validasi Gagal [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": ""
}
